<%# locals: (title:) %>
<%#
  The `gap-2.5` and the empty `w-5` are `layouts/_header`'s gap and mark slot, reproduced so a
  pushed screen's title starts at the same x as the header's; change either and change both.

  The title is the section noun - "Event", "Member", "New group" - never the record's name, which
  is the body's first heading.
%>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
  <span class="flex-none w-5" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <h1 class="text-shell sm:text-hero truncate"><%= title %></h1>
</div>
